── Data & third-party sources ────────────────────────────────────────────────
This license covers the Niyantran source code only. Live data is fetched from
third-party providers (GDELT, Yahoo Finance, RSS publishers, OpenSky, aisstream,
GLEIF, data.gov.in and others), each under its own terms. Yahoo Finance data in
particular is unofficial and not licensed for commercial redistribution — swap
in a licensed market-data vendor before any paid launch. Respect each source's
terms and rate limits.
